    return (doc, token), float(value)

"""Approximate a negative pulse for formatting punctuation opening a line.

Recognize bullets, diffs, comments, quote/table bars, headings and JSON openers.
Indentation weakens the pulse; blank lines and repeated comment/table markers
strengthen it. Ordinary words are left at zero. Document-initial line endings
and end-of-document markers receive a separate position-dependent transient.
