"""A spelling-based detector for trans- and related transfer/change words.

Bare trans- gives the strongest negative response. Longer words about
translation, transfer, transit, transmission, transparency and transformation
have smaller family-specific responses. A few counterparts in other scripts
also respond. Split-word endings and an immediately following 'of' carry a
weaker response. Unrecognized tokens get zero; document changes reset state.
This approximates the prominent lexical response, not every small activation.
