The strongest observed response completes 'applied' as 'ap' + 'plied'.
It is weaker in 'misapplied' or when punctuation is packaged with 'ap'.
Related split endings in 'implied' and 'supplied' also respond negatively.
A few control/separator tokens have stable small responses. Other tokens
